reen spaces"},{"text":"Wetlands"},{"text":"Water bodies"},{"text":"Urban heat"},{"text":"Air-quality patterns"},{"text":"Ecological corridors"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Regional Planning"},{"type":"p","text":"Move beyond individual cities."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Urban-rural relationships"},{"text":"Regional growth"},{"text":"Metropolitan regions"},{"text":"Economic corridors"},{"text":"Industrial corridors"},{"text":"Infrastructure networks"},{"text":"Settlement hierarchy"},{"text":"Regional accessibility"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A GIS Planner should understand the difference between:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Site Scale","Neighborhood","City","Metropolitan Region","District","State / Region"]},{"type":"h","text":"GIS + Urban Planning Workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Planning Problem","Data Collection","GIS Database","Spatial Analysis","Scenario Development","Planning Alternatives","Impact Assessment","Planning Recommendation","Policy / Plan"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Web GIS"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop basic web-mapping skills."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Interactive maps"},{"text":"Web map layers"},{"text":"Map services"},{"text":"Dashboards"},{"text":"GeoJSON"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"Spatial web applications"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful technologies:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"JavaScript"},{"text":"Leaflet"},{"text":"MapLibre/Mapbox-style mapping platforms"},{"text":"GeoServer"},{"text":"PostGIS"},{"text":"You do not need to become a full-stack developer, but understanding how spatial data reaches a web interface is increasingly valuable."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Core Technical Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Planning"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Urban planning"},{"text":"Regional planning"},{"text":"Land-use planning"},{"text":"Zoning"},{"text":"Transportation planning"},{"text":"Environmental planning"},{"text":"Development control"}]},{"ty