ic transport."},{"type":"p","text":"Combine:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Transit stops"},{"text":"Road network"},{"text":"Population"},{"text":"Walking distance"},{"text":"Employment centers"},{"text":"Land use"},{"text":"Produce accessibility maps and identify underserved areas."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Urban Flood-Risk Mapping"},{"type":"p","text":"Combine:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Elevation"},{"text":"Drainage"},{"text":"Rainfall"},{"text":"Land cover"},{"text":"Built-up areas"},{"text":"Water bodies"},{"text":"Population"},{"text":"Then develop a flood-risk map and planning recommendations."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Urban Green-Space Equity Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyze whether residents have reasonable access to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Parks"},{"text":"Green spaces"},{"text":"Recreational areas"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Combine:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Population"},{"text":"Income/social indicators where appropriate"},{"text":"Park locations"},{"text":"Walking networks"},{"text":"Road networks"},{"text":"Then identify underserved neighborhoods."}]}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"h","text":"Urban Planning Consultancies"},{"type":"p","text":"Roles:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GIS Intern"},{"text":"Planning Intern"},{"text":"Urban Analytics Intern"},{"text":"Spatial Planning Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"GIS / Geospatial Companies"},{"type":"p","text":"Roles:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GIS Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Geospatial Data Intern"},{"text":"Spatial Data Analyst Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Government Planning Agencies"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Master planning"},{"text":"Land-use mapping"},{"text":"Urban development"},{"text":"Infrastructure planning"},{"text":"GIS databases"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Transportation Consultancies"},{"type":"p","text":"Lear